Package: ssDamageHunter
Type: Package
Title: Single-Stranded DNA Damage Calling from PTA-Based Single-Cell WGS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shulin", "Mao", email = "shulin_mao@fas.harvard.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Identifies single-stranded DNA damage in single-cell whole-genome sequencing data. Starting from
    the somatic candidate set, each candidate is assigned
    likelihoods under three competing hypotheses -- a double-stranded somatic
    mutation, single-stranded damage present on only one strand, and an
    amplification or sequencing error -- and classified accordingly. Also
    provides detection-sensitivity and effective-callable-region estimation for
    converting counts into per-genome burdens.
